{"sourceUrl":"https://european.tjfsu.edu.cn/info/1062/3497.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:13.709680+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://european.tjfsu.edu.cn/info/1062/3497.htm","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span>天津外国语大学欧洲语言文化学院推免生接收录取工作根据教育部研究生招生工作有关规定，及我校《天津外国语大学</span><span>2027年推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生招生录取工作办法》执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>一、申请和接收程序</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>. </span><span>具有推免生资格的考生</span><span>于</span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span>开始登录</span><span>“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址:</span> <span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）进行注册、确认、支付等手续，在该系统填报我校相关接收专业。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span>欧洲语言文化</span><span>学院推免生工作小组对申请者进行资格审核、筛选，确定推免生</span><span>考核</span><span><span>名单。学院通过</span><span>“推免服务系统”向进入复试的推免生发送</span></span><span>考核</span><span>通知</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span> <span>3. </span></span><span>校研招办根据各专业</span><span>考核</span><span><span>结果确定拟录取名单，在</span><span>“推免服务系统”发出待录取通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4. </span><span>接收推免生</span><span>考核</span><span>工作采用远程网络</span><span>面试</span><span>形式，拟使用</span><span><span>腾讯会议</span></span><span>。拟报名参加我院</span><span>考核</span><span>的推免</span><span>生请于</span><strong><span>9月2</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>19:00</span></strong><strong><span>前</span></strong><span>将以下材料电子版打</span><span><span>包发送至</span><span>ouyufs@tjfsu.edu.cn，邮件主题：“推免+报考专业名称+考生姓名”（所有材料提供原件扫描件即可）</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>有效居民身份证（正反面）。若身份证丢失，须提交临时身份证（有效期内）或公安机关开具的户籍证明（贴有本人近期一寸免冠照片、盖骑缝章）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>教育部学籍在线验证报告（中国高等教育学生信息网）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>大学学习成绩单及排名证明（加盖所在学校教务处公章）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）外语水平证明。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>遴选推荐阶段提交的科研创新成果、竞赛</span></span><span>奖项</span><span><span>等材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>6</span><span>）申请攻读硕士</span></span><span><span>研究生</span></span><span>报告。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>7</span><span>）考生诚信承诺书（打印纸质版，手写签名）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>如系统接到</span><span>考核</span><span>通知</span><span>，考生需</span><span>缴纳</span><span>考核</span><span>费用</span><span>，请</span><span><span>登录我校网上交费平台（网址：</span></span><a href=\"http://211.68.223.48/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"http://211.68.223.51/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://211.68.223.5</span></a><span>1</span><span><span>）进行缴费</span></span><span><span>（缴费方式见附件）</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>费</span>90元/生，缴费后考生因个人原因不能参加</span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>的，已支付的</span></span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>费不予退回。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二、考核形式及内容</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>考核</span><span>采用以面试为主的综合考核</span><span>方式</span><span>，</span><span>具体考核内容请以现场考官提问为准</span><span>：</span></p>\n<p><span>俄语</span><span>语言文学</span><span><span>（含</span><span>MTI）</span></span><span>：</span><span>主要考查考生的专业文化知识、语言运用能力和交流能力等，最终按照</span><span>考核</span><span>成绩排名，择优录取。</span><span>其中，</span><span>俄语基础知识</span><span>占</span><span>60%（朗读短文10%</span><span>，</span><span><span>短文翻译</span><span>30%</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>按短文内容回答问题</span><span>20%)</span></span><span>；</span><span>俄</span><span>语综合</span><span>知识</span><span>、</span><span>自由交流</span><span>占</span><span>40%</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>法语</span><span>语言文学</span><span><span>（含</span><span>MTI）：</span></span><span>主要考查考生的专业文化知识、语言运用能力和交流能力等，最终按照</span><span>考核</span><span>成绩排名，择优录取。</span><span>其中，</span><span>法汉互译</span><span>占</span><span>60%（法译汉：30%，汉译法：30%）；法国文学文化</span><span>占</span><span>40%。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>德语语言文学（含</span><span>MTI）：针对考生申请的专业方向，对考生的专业和语言基础进行重点考核。考核内容还包括考生的专业知识，回答关于德语教学法、语言学、文化和国情等方面的问题；对报考翻译专业的考生，要进行现场翻译考核。满分100分。最终按照</span></span><span>考核</span><span>成绩排名，择优录取。</span></p>\n<p><span>西班牙语</span><span>语言文学</span><span><span>（含</span><span>MTI）：主要考查考生的专业文化知识、语言运用能力和交流能力等，最终按照</span></span><span>考核</span><span>成绩排名，择优录取。</span><span>其中，</span><span>西汉互译</span><span>占</span><span>60%（西译汉30%，汉译西30%）；西语语言文化综合能力考察，</span><span>自由</span><span>交流</span><span>占</span><span>40%。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>意大利语</span></span><span><span>语言文学</span></span><span><span>（含</span><span>MTI）</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>共分三部分。第一部分自我介绍；第二部分读文章回答问题；第三部分观点论述，重点考查专业知识能力及基础语言交流能力。满分</span><span>100分。最终按照考核成绩排名，择优录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>葡萄牙语语言文学：共分两部分。第一部分阅读文章并翻译；第二部分自由问答，考查专业知识能力及基础语言交流能力。满分</span><span>100分。最终按照考核成绩排名，择优录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、</span></strong><strong><span>考核安排</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.面试时间：</span></p>\n<p><span>俄语</span><span>语言文学</span><span><span>（含</span><span>MTI）</span></span><span>：</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日</span><span>9:30</span><span>开始</span></p>\n<p><span>法语</span><span>语言文学</span><span><span>（含</span><span>MTI）：</span></span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日</span><span>9:30</span><span>开始</span></p>\n<p><span>西班牙语</span><span>语言文学</span><span><span>（含</span><span>MTI）：</span></span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日</span><span>12:00</span><span>开始</span></p>\n<p><span>德语</span><span>语言文学</span><span><span>（含</span><span>MTI）：</span></span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日</span><span>14:00</span><span>开始</span></p>\n<p><span>意大利语</span><span>语言文学</span><span><span>（含</span><span>MTI）</span></span><span>：</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>23</span><span>日</span><span>13:15</span><span>开始</span></p>\n<p><span>葡萄牙语语言文学：</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>23</span><span>日</span><span>13:15</span><span>开始</span></p>\n<p><span>开始时间可能根据报名情况进行调整，根据录取情况决定是否安排第二场次考核，请考生及时关注相关通知。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>面试地点：网络远程面试</span></p>\n<p><span><span>网络远程面试考生采用</span><span>“双机位”，具体要求及形式请务必参看附件网络远程复试考生须知，并按要求提前做好相应准备。网络远程面试前会进行考核资格审查、考生软件平台测试等，具体时间安排以学院通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四、其他规定</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>已被</span><span>我校</span><span>录取的推免生，不得再报名参加当年全国统一考试、单独考试。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.对于获得“中国国际大学生创新大赛”国赛银奖及以上、“天开杯”创聚津门全国大学生智能科技创新创业挑战赛一等奖及以上等在科研创新方面具有突出表现的学生，取得推荐资格并进入复试后，考生提出申请的，在综合考核成绩相同的情况下，经学校研究生招生委员会审定，予以优先录取。</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>推免生入学后第一学年享有研究生一等学业奖学金</span><span>10000元</span><span><span>，以及每年</span><span>6000元研究生国家助学金。表现优秀者就读期间还可申请硕士研究生国家奖学金，奖金20000元/年。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span>.<span>推免生出现下列情况之一的，不予录取或取消录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>未经</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>的考生不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>对报考资格不符合规定者不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）综合考核</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>低于</span>60<span>分为不合格，不合格不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）</span></span><span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核结果不合格者，不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>未经我校公示的考生，不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>6</span><span>）在</span><span>2027</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>入学报到之日</span></span><span>前</span><span><span>未取得学</span></span><span><span>士</span></span><span><span>学位或本科毕业证书的考生，取消录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>受违法处理或违纪、作弊处分</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>不予录取或取消录取资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>8</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>经查实存在弄虚作假，论文抄袭，虚报获奖、科研成果等学术不端行为或有其他影响</span></span><span><span>招生录取</span></span><span><span>过程和结果公平公正行为</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>不予录取或取消录取资格</span></span><span><span>。如入学后查实，取消学籍。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>）其他</span></span><span><span>不予录取或</span></span><span><span>取消</span></span><span><span>录取资格</span></span><span><span>的情形。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5.</span><span>本</span><span>细则及其它未尽事宜</span><span>由</span><span>欧洲语言文化学院</span><span>负责解释。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>五、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院网站：</span><span>http://european.tjfsu.edu.cn/                     </span></span></p>\n<p><span>联系人：</span><span>崔老师</span> </p>\n<p><span>联系电话：</span><span><span>13102109303</span></span></p>\n<p><span>022-23280731</span> </p>\n<p><span><span>邮</span>  <span>箱：</span></span><span><span>ouyufs@tjfsu.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"23ce8d9f306295c557d3c886afbbba61b4d0455f9ec5fae2bd036722306f6c0a","textLength":2467,"sourceSha256":"d2c3fc324ce6c8b160fd4ff191f39cce8a27bd0370d9e85bf3f829c5b848adeb","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1 考生诚信复试承诺书.doc","url":"https://european.tjfsu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1167733717&wbfileid=3914857"},{"name":"附件2  天津外国语大学2027年硕士研究生接收推免生复试缴费说明.doc","url":"https://european.tjfsu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1167733717&wbfileid=3914858"},{"name":"附件3 网络远程复试考生须知.docx","url":"https://european.tjfsu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1167733717&wbfileid=3914859"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-966ed154218f20c2c47d","title":"2026年天津外国语大学欧洲语言文化学院2027年推免招生录取工作实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:13.709680+00:00"}
